id: 9
hanzi: 离婚
pinyin: lí hūn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to divorce; to dissolve a marriage
  es: divorciarse; disolver el matrimonio

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to legally dissolve a marriage relationship between husband and wife | disolver legalmente el vínculo matrimonial entre los cónyuges | 协议离婚 (divorce by mutual agreement)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 经过反复沟通与理性权衡，他们发现彼此的价值观差异过大，最终决定和平离婚并共同承担抚养孩子的责任。 | Jīngguò fǎnfù gōutōng yǔ lǐxìng quánhéng, tāmen fāxiàn bǐcǐ de jiàzhíguān chāyì guò dà, zuìzhōng juédìng hépíng líhūn bìng gòngtóng chéngdān fǔyǎng háizi de zérèn. | After repeated dialogue and rational deliberation, they realized their value disparities were insurmountable and ultimately chose an amicable divorce, sharing custody of their child. | Tras un diálogo constante y reflexivo, comprendieron que sus diferencias eran insalvables y decidieron divorciarse de forma amistosa compartiendo la crianza de sus hijos.
  #2 | 最新出台的民法典关于婚姻家庭编的司法解释中，对夫妻共同债务清偿及诉讼离婚财产分割作出了更明确的指引。 | Zuìxīn chūtái de mínfǎdiǎn guānyú hūnyīn jiātíng biān de sīfǎ jiěshì zhōng, duì fūqī gòngtóng zhàiwù qīngchǎng jí sùsòng líhūn cáichǎn fēngē zuòchū le gèng míngquè de zhǐyǐn. | In recent judicial interpretations of the Civil Code marriage chapter, clearer guidelines were established regarding spousal joint debt settlement and property division in contentious divorces. | En la reciente interpretación judicial del Código Civil sobre familia, se fijaron pautas más claras para la liquidación de deudas conyugales y la división de bienes en juicios de divorcio.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  协议离婚 | divorce by mutual agreement
  诉讼离婚 | divorce through judicial litigation
  申请离婚 | file for divorce
  办理离婚 | handle divorce formalities
  离婚率 | divorce rate
  离婚冷静期 | divorce cooling-off period

